---
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import '../../styles/global.css';
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <title>Bend Oregon SEO Consultant | SEO Services in Bend, OR</title>
    <meta name="description" content="SEO consulting and organic search strategy for Bend, Oregon businesses that want better rankings, more visibility, stronger local search performance, and more qualified leads." />
  </head>

  <body>
    <Header />

    <main>
      <section class="page-hero">
        <div class="container narrow">
          <p class="section-label">Bend Oregon SEO Services</p>
          <h1>SEO help for Bend businesses that want to show up where customers are searching.</h1>
          <p>
            I help Bend businesses improve organic search visibility, clean up technical SEO issues,
            build stronger local pages, and turn search traffic into leads, bookings, and revenue.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="services">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="service-grid three">
            <div class="service-card">
              <h2>Local SEO Strategy</h2>
              <p>
                Improve how your business appears for Bend-area searches, map results, service terms,
                and high-intent local keywords.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="service-card">
              <h2>Website SEO</h2>
              <p>
                Strengthen title tags, page structure, internal links, headings, crawlability, and the
                content signals search engines use to understand your site.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="service-card">
              <h2>Content Planning</h2>
              <p>
                Build service pages, location pages, guides, and supporting content that bring in people
                looking for exactly what you offer.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="content-section">
        <div class="container narrow">
          <h2>SEO consulting for Bend, Oregon businesses</h2>
          <p>
            Bend is competitive. Whether you run a local service business, outdoor brand, real estate
            business, healthcare practice, restaurant, tourism company, or professional service firm,
            people are searching before they call, book, visit, or buy.
          </p>

          <p>
            My work focuses on helping your website become clearer, more useful, and easier to find.
            That can include local SEO, technical fixes, better page structure, new content, keyword
            research, reporting, and practical search strategy tied to business goals.
          </p>

          <h2>What I can help with</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>Local SEO for Bend-area searches</li>
            <li>Google Business Profile and local listing strategy</li>
            <li>SEO audits and technical cleanup</li>
            <li>Service page and location page planning</li>
            <li>Keyword research and content strategy</li>
            <li>Internal linking and site structure improvements</li>
            <li>Organic traffic, lead, and revenue reporting</li>
            <li>AI search and broader search visibility strategy</li>
          </ul>

          <h2>Good fit for businesses that want more than rankings</h2>
          <p>
            Rankings matter, but they are not the whole point. The real goal is getting in front of the
            right people and helping them take the next step. I look at search visibility, page quality,
            user intent, conversion paths, and how SEO supports revenue.
          </p>

          <h2>Work with a Bend-based SEO consultant</h2>
          <p>
            I live in Central Oregon and understand how people search for local businesses here. That
            helps when building pages around Bend neighborhoods, nearby towns, seasonal demand, tourism,
            outdoor activities, and local service searches.
          </p>

          <p>
            <a class="button" href="/contact/">Contact Me About Bend SEO</a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>
